<title>CANADA: Revenue Properties to buy Las Vegas mall.</title>
<headline>Revenue Properties to buy Las Vegas mall.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revenue Properties Company Ltd on Friday said its Pan Pacific Development Inc unit has agreed to purchase a 130,500 square food mall in Las Vegas, Nevada, for C$21 million (US$15.3 million).</p>
</text>
